# Every key this workbench reads, with no values. Copy to .env.<your-deployment> and fill in.
# Secrets belong in .env.local, which nothing here commits and the door never reads directly:
# what reads it is the measurement logger, to redact those VALUES from its own log.
#
# The env scheme has three buckets. .env.defaults holds what is true of every deployment;
# .env.<name> holds one deployment; .env.local holds secrets. None is committed.

